# Who gets asked to review what, in two-web.
#
# SUPERSEDED - DO NOT COPY THIS OVER two-web/.github/CODEOWNERS.
# The Web Lead committed a fuller version in two-web itself (TWO-39), and TOG-128
# has since rewritten it. That file is the source of truth; this copy is only the
# record of which paths the bot side expects to be routed. See ../README.md.
#
# This used to name @two-gaming/<team> handles, on the reasoning that a team
# review request never dies because one account is asleep. The teams went with
# the org: the repos are in TogetherWeOwn now and it has no teams. A CODEOWNERS
# rule naming a handle without write access is dropped by GitHub silently - no
# warning, no reviewer - so a template still naming them was a trap for whoever
# copied it next. Handles below match what TOG-128 landed in two-web. Promote
# back to real teams when a second person has write access; the path split below
# is already drawn along those lines.

# Default: the application.
*                             @Rick7C2

# Anything a member sees: markup, styles and JS. Views call into the backend, so
# frontend and backend concerns meet here.
/resources/views/             @Rick7C2
/resources/js/                @Rick7C2
/resources/css/               @Rick7C2
/tailwind.config.js           @Rick7C2
/vite.config.js               @Rick7C2

# Backend: schema, policies, and the request path.
/app/                         @Rick7C2
/routes/                      @Rick7C2
/database/                    @Rick7C2
/config/                      @Rick7C2

# Tests and CI. "Make CI green" is the easiest thing in the repo to get wrong on
# purpose, so these paths are called out even though the owner is the same.
/tests/                       @Rick7C2
/.github/workflows/           @Rick7C2
/phpunit.xml                  @Rick7C2
/phpstan.neon                 @Rick7C2
/pint.json                    @Rick7C2

# The boundary with the bot. The website reads the bot's contract and must never
# hold the bot token.
/config/services.php          @Rick7C2
/app/Services/Discord/        @Rick7C2

# Secrets posture.
/.env.example                 @Rick7C2
/.gitignore                   @Rick7C2
